{"ref":"BDB, אָדֹם²","hw":"אָדֹם²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָדֹם</span></big>  <strong>adj. red</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.2\">Is 63:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.8\">Zc 1:8</a> + <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:30\" href=\"/Genesis.25.30\">Gn 25:30</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, v. infr.; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.10\">Ct 5:10</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדֻמָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:2\" href=\"/Numbers.19.2\">Nu 19:2</a>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדֻמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.22\">2 K 3:22</a> + 2 textual;—<em>ruddy, red</em>, of man <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.10\">Ct 5:10</a>; horse <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.8\">Zc 1:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂרֹק</span> cf. As.Dl<sup>W 87</sup> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.2\">6:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁחֹר</span>); heifer <a data-ref=\"Numbers 19:2\" href=\"/Numbers.19.2\">Nu 19:2</a>; water <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.22\">2 K 3:22</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(א׳ כַּדָּם)</span>; cf. as subst. <em>red, redness</em> on garment <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.2\">Is 63:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאָדֹם</span> = <em>the</em> (<em>red</em>) <em>lentils</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:30\" href=\"/Genesis.25.30\">Gn 25:30</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, but rd. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאֱדֹם</span> v. infr.; cf. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, מַעֲלֶה\" href=\"/BDB,_מַעֲלֶה\", dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲלֶה</a>.","next":"BDB, אֹ֫דֶם","prev":"BDB, אָדֹם"}